# Exception: Claude Code cloud sessions only see what is in the clone, so the
# rendered project settings (hooks, permissions, plugin marketplaces) have to be
# committed or cloud sessions start with no tooling at all. Regenerated by
# postinstall from external/ag-shared/.claude-settings.template.json — commit the
# diff when it changes. See external/ag-shared/docs/claude-code-cloud-sessions.md.
